# Taskmaster (lean)

- Source of truth: `.taskmaster/tasks/tasks.json` (tag `master`).
- Work the lowest-id pending task whose dependencies are done.
- After a task ships, set `"status": "done"` in that file. Do not call `parse_prd` or `expand_task` (wastes API tokens).
- MCP for this repo is `TASK_MASTER_TOOLS=core` only.
